# The build context is the directory holding both checkouts, which may hold a
# good deal else. Everything is excluded, and exactly what the Dockerfile
# copies is let back in: never node_modules, dist, .git, or a local shelf,
# which is somebody's data and never belongs in an image.
*
!ohagi/package.json
!ohagi/package-lock.json
!ohagi/tsconfig.json
!ohagi/src
!ohagi/client
!ohagi/scripts/build-client.mjs
!mochiforge/src
